[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Tables
[/meta]

h1. Tables

Tests for Section 11 of the specification.

h2. Header rows

h3. Header row and body rows {#tables-basic}
[code om]
|| Name || Age || City ||
| Alice | 30 | Paris |
| Bob | 25 | London |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Age</th><th scope="col">City</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Alice</td><td>30</td><td>Paris</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Bob</td><td>25</td><td>London</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Table without a header row {#tables-no-header}
[code om]
| Alice | 30 |
| Bob | 25 |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Alice</td><td>30</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Bob</td><td>25</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Header row only {#tables-header-only}
[code om]
|| A || B ||
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col">A</th><th scope="col">B</th></tr>
  </thead>
</table>
[/code]

h2. Rows

h3. Trailing delimiter is optional {#tables-rows-no-trailing-delimiter}
[code om]
| a | b
| c | d |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td>c</td><td>d</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Trailing double delimiter only closes the cell {#tables-rows-trailing-double}
[code om]
| a ||
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Double delimiter inside a row opens a header cell {#tables-rows-inner-double}
[code om]
| a || c |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><th scope="row">c</th></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. A table ends at the first line that is not a row {#tables-rows-end}
[code om]
| a | b |
Text after the table.
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p>Text after the table.</p>
[/code]

h3. A row ends a paragraph without a blank line {#tables-rows-interrupt-paragraph}
[code om]
Prices:
| Tea | 3 |
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Prices:</p>
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Tea</td><td>3</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Indented rows {#tables-rows-indented}
[code om]
  | a | b |
  | c | d |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td>c</td><td>d</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h2. Row headers

h3. Row headers below a header row {#tables-row-headers}
[code om]
|| Day || Opens || Closes ||
|| Monday | 9:00 | 18:00 |
|| Saturday | 10:00 | 14:00 |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col">Day</th><th scope="col">Opens</th><th scope="col">Closes</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><th scope="row">Monday</th><td>9:00</td><td>18:00</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">Saturday</th><td>10:00</td><td>14:00</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Mixed first row is a body row {#tables-mixed-first-row}
[code om]
|| Monday | 9:00 |
|| Tuesday | 10:00 |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><th scope="row">Monday</th><td>9:00</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">Tuesday</th><td>10:00</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. All-header row that is not first is a row of row headers {#tables-header-cells-later-row}
[code om]
| a | b |
|| c || d ||
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">c</th><th scope="row">d</th></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h2. Column alignment

h3. Left, center and right {#tables-align-basic}
[code om]
||< Name ||>< Age ||> Salary ||
| Alice | 30 | €50,000 |
| Bob | 25 | €45,000 |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th scope="col" style="text-align: left">Name</th>
      <th scope="col" style="text-align: center">Age</th>
      <th scope="col" style="text-align: right">Salary</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td style="text-align: left">Alice</td>
      <td style="text-align: center">30</td>
      <td style="text-align: right">€50,000</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="text-align: left">Bob</td>
      <td style="text-align: center">25</td>
      <td style="text-align: right">€45,000</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Justify {#tables-align-justify}
[code om]
||<> Text ||
| Some words |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col" style="text-align: justify">Text</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td style="text-align: justify">Some words</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Only marked columns are aligned {#tables-align-partial}
[code om]
|| Item ||> Price ||
| Tea | 3 |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col" style="text-align: right">Price</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Tea</td><td style="text-align: right">3</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Alignment markers outside the header row are content {#tables-align-body-row}
[code om]
|| Day || Hours ||
||> Monday | 9 to 18 |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col">Day</th><th scope="col">Hours</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><th scope="row">&gt; Monday</th><td>9 to 18</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Alignment applies to row headers {#tables-align-row-headers}
[code om]
||> Day || Hours ||
|| Monday | 9 |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col" style="text-align: right">Day</th><th scope="col">Hours</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><th scope="row" style="text-align: right">Monday</th><td>9</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Space before the marker makes it content {#tables-align-space}
[code om]
|| < 5 || Result ||
| yes | small |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col">&lt; 5</th><th scope="col">Result</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>yes</td><td>small</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Escaped angle bracket is not an alignment marker {#tables-align-escaped}
[code om]
||\< 5 || Result ||
| yes | small |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col">&lt; 5</th><th scope="col">Result</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>yes</td><td>small</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h2. Cell spans

h3. Column span in a body row {#tables-span-colspan}
[code om]
| a | b | c |
|{2} wide | d |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td><td>c</td></tr>
    <tr><td colspan="2">wide</td><td>d</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Column span in the header row {#tables-span-header-colspan}
[code om]
||{2} Name || Age ||
| First | Last | 30 |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col" colspan="2">Name</th><th scope="col">Age</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>First</td><td>Last</td><td>30</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Row span {#tables-span-rowspan}
[code om]
|{x2} tall | b |
| c |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td rowspan="2">tall</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Row span in a later column {#tables-span-rowspan-later-column}
[code om]
| a |{x2} tall | c |
| d | f |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td rowspan="2">tall</td><td>c</td></tr>
    <tr><td>d</td><td>f</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Column and row span together {#tables-span-both}
[code om]
|{2x2} big | a |
| b |
| c | d | e |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td colspan="2" rowspan="2">big</td><td>a</td></tr>
    <tr><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td>c</td><td>d</td><td>e</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Row header spanning rows {#tables-span-row-header}
[code om]
|| Day || Shift || Hours ||
||{x2} Monday | Morning | 4 |
| Evening | 3 |
|| Total |{2} 7 |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col">Day</th><th scope="col">Shift</th><th scope="col">Hours</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><th scope="row" rowspan="2">Monday</th><td>Morning</td><td>4</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Evening</td><td>3</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">Total</th><td colspan="2">7</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Span after an alignment marker {#tables-span-after-alignment}
[code om]
||><{2} Group || C ||
|{2} both | c |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col" style="text-align: center" colspan="2">Group</th><th scope="col">C</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td style="text-align: center" colspan="2">both</td><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Row span reaching exactly the last row {#tables-span-rowspan-to-end}
[code om]
| a |{x3} tall |
| b |
| c |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td rowspan="3">tall</td></tr>
    <tr><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Braces after whitespace are cell text {#tables-span-space}
[code om]
| {2} a | b |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>{2} a</td><td>b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Zero span is an error {#tables-span-error-zero}
[code om]
| a | b |
|{0} c | d |
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-span 2
[/code]

h3. Uppercase separator is an error {#tables-span-error-uppercase}
[code om]
|{2X2} a | b |
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-span 1
[/code]

h3. Words inside the braces are an error {#tables-span-error-words}
[code om]
|{wide} a | b |
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-span 1
[/code]

h3. Row span in the header row is an error {#tables-span-error-header-rowspan}
[code om]
||{x2} A || B ||
| a | b |
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-span 1
[/code]

h3. Row span past the last row is an error {#tables-span-error-past-end}
[code om]
|{x3} tall | b |
| c |
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-span 1
[/code]

h2. Width rule

h3. Row narrower than the first row {#tables-width-narrower}
[code om]
|| A || B ||
| x |
[/code]
[code error]
uneven-table-row 2
[/code]

h3. Row wider than the first row {#tables-width-wider}
[code om]
|| A || B ||
| x | y | z |
[/code]
[code error]
uneven-table-row 2
[/code]

h3. First row sets the width without a header {#tables-width-no-header}
[code om]
| a |
| b | c |
[/code]
[code error]
uneven-table-row 2
[/code]

h3. Column span counts toward the width {#tables-width-colspan-too-wide}
[code om]
| a | b |
|{2} c | d |
[/code]
[code error]
uneven-table-row 2
[/code]

h3. Column span in the first row sets the width {#tables-width-first-row-colspan}
[code om]
|{3} wide |
| a | b |
[/code]
[code error]
uneven-table-row 2
[/code]

h3. Slot filled from above counts toward the width {#tables-width-rowspan-too-wide}
[code om]
|{x2} tall | b |
| c | d |
[/code]
[code error]
uneven-table-row 2
[/code]

h3. Forgotten cell under a row span {#tables-width-rowspan-too-narrow}
[code om]
| a | b | c |
|{x2} tall | d | e |
| f |
[/code]
[code error]
uneven-table-row 3
[/code]

h2. Whitespace and empty cells

h3. Whitespace around content is trimmed {#tables-whitespace-trimmed}
[code om]
|     Alice     |30|
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Alice</td><td>30</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Whitespace inside content is kept {#tables-whitespace-inner}
[code om]
| two  spaces | x |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>two  spaces</td><td>x</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Empty cell {#tables-empty-cell}
[code om]
| a | | c |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td></td><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Escaped space is a kept non-breaking space {#tables-escaped-space}
[code om]
| a | \ | c |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h2. Cell content

h3. Inline formatting in cells {#tables-inline-formatting}
[code om]
| *bold* | _italic_ | [Docs]:https://example.com |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><strong>bold</strong></td><td><em>italic</em></td><td><a href="https://example.com">Docs</a></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Pipe inside a code span does not split the cell {#tables-pipe-in-code}
[code om]
| `a|b` | c |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>a|b</code></td><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. Escaped pipe {#tables-escaped-pipe}
[code om]
| a \| b | c |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a | b</td><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h3. List marker inside a cell is text {#tables-list-marker-text}
[code om]
| * item | x |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>* item</td><td>x</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]

h2. Profiles

h3. Tables are not allowed in the basic profile {#tables-profile-basic}
; profile
: basic
[code om]
| a | b |
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]

h3. Tables are allowed in the standard profile {#tables-profile-standard}
; profile
: standard
[code om]
| a | b |
[/code]
[code html]
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
[/code]
